Package: VariationalBayesHLRM
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Inference for Linear, Hierarchical, and Clustered Regression
Version: 0.2.10
Authors@R: person("Cristian", "Parra", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "cristian.parra@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: Cristian Parra [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Cristian Parra <cristian.parra@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Fits Gaussian linear regression, hierarchical linear regression,
    and clustered hierarchical linear regression models using Markov chain
    Monte Carlo, coordinate-ascent variational inference, or stochastic
    variational inference. Provides explicit prior and simulation contracts,
    posterior prediction, predictive scoring, cross-validation, posterior
    predictive checks, dependency-light diagnostic plots, and mixture
    relabeling.
